Z||000000||moneyguns&lawyers||12-15-2001||06:56 PM||||Hi All -<P>Just wanted to say hi and thank you! I've been lurking aroung the forum for about 5 months since I finally bought my Fiero (yippie!)  Thanks to you I knew what to look for. I've just finished my first homegrown Fiero repair (the stripped gear in the headlight motor) - I normally would have shelled out $$$ for a new motor but thanks to the info here was able to fix it for under $2 (cost of screws and nuts).<P>Thanks again and have a great Christmas!!!||||reg||14
